 The original version of this package included an optional "seconds" field, which
 made it incompatible with both of these formats. Now, the "standard" format is
 the default format accepted, and the Quartz format is opt-in.
+
+## Pause and resume
+
+Pause(id) keeps an entry and its history while preventing future dispatch. It
+returns true only on a state change. Resume(id) reactivates a paused entry from
+current time, without replaying missed runs. Stopped resumes defer scheduling.
+Inspect Entry.Paused and its zero Next to recognize a paused entry. Running jobs
+finish normally, and Stop still waits for them. Removed IDs cannot be resumed.
